Z||000007||Wannabe||12-08-2000||07:35 PM||||It amazes me, looking for SD four parts. Here's an engine that dominated many forms of racing for half a decade, and it's almost impossible to find parts lying around. You'd think there would be plenty of circle track racers with pieces or old engines lying in their garages etc etc etc. Instead, these things seem to have been wiped off the face of the earth. Pulling 300hp from a 2.8 v6 is a nightmare. A mild SD4 woud do it easily, what a shame they are gone.||||reg||1
